                        rendition="#italic">Nazi-Soviet Relations, 1989–1941</hi> (Washington,
                    Government Printing Office, 1948), p. 76. For correspondence, see <ref
                        target="#pg312">pp. 312</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d406-f3" n="11" xml:id="d406-f3-content">
                <p>Ivan Andres.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
